# Flash-attention forward, warp-specialized: one persistent CTA of 8
# warps walks tiles, two 4-warp partitions each own 64 query rows, its
# shared memory all set at launch; warps 0-3 run the first partition's
# blocks, block 2 where the CTA-uniform `%ctaid.x < param_10` holds.
# mbarrier waits are scoped self-loops. Every trip count is unknown,
# with its reason on its loop's header: the key-block loop's exit is not
# at its latch, the inner key loop's bound is the tile's query block,
# which the tile loop carries, the wait loops spin on
# `mbarrier.test_wait`, and the persistent tile loop has a latch per
# partition (PLAN.md); so the kernel's FLOPs and bytes per CTA are
# unknown, each naming a loop it reads.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze --annotate %fixtures/gluon/attn_fwd_ws_kernel.sm_89.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry attn_fwd_ws_kernel( // block 256×1×1 | shared memory 0 B/CTA + dynamic | per CTA: flops f32 ? (trips of $L__BB0_39); tensor flops bf16 ? (trips of $L__BB0_39); sfu flops f32 ? (trips of $L__BB0_39); global load ? B (trips of $L__BB0_39), store ? B (trips of $L__BB0_39); shared load ? B (trips of $L__BB0_2), store ? B (trips of $L__BB0_39); param load 17,408 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	setp.eq.b32 	%p58, %r1753, 0; // [<block 1>] warp 0-3 × lane * | exec 128/CTA{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	add.s64 	%rd162, %rd37, %rd155; // [<block 2>] warp 0-3 × lane * | runs when %ctaid.x < param_10 (CTA-uniform, branch at line 257) | exec <= 128/CTA{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_39:                             // =>This Loop Header: Depth=1 // loop: trips ? (loop exit is not at the latch) | warp 0-3 × lane * | under line 260 | exec ?{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	waitLoop: // loop: trips ? (latch predicate is defined by `mbarrier.test_wait.parity.shared::cta.b64`, not a comparison) | warp 0-3 × lane * | under line 260 | exec ?{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_43:                             // %.lr.ph601 // loop: trips ? (uniform(%r1884@$L__BB0_43) is defined in an enclosing loop: depends on %r1884, carried around an enclosing loop) | warp 0-3 × lane * | under line 664 | exec ?{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_2:                              // %.preheader568 // loop: trips ? (loop has multiple latches) | warp 4-7 × lane * | exec ?{{$}}
